\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6.3}{\ignorespaces Downstream recommendation performance on the Amazon Beauty dataset. We report the test-set ranking metrics and the pre-deduplication uniqueness ratio (as a proxy for codebook health). Results show the mean over 3 runs. GHRQ-VAE employs the block-level gradient routing, though its depth-stabilizing effect at this depth ($n_q=4$) is negligible compared to the uncorrected variant. The best values per column are highlighted in bold.}}{20}{table.6.3}\protected@file@percent }
